   "text": "Each request alone may fit in the 1 GB, but the pool is shared:\nC + A together ask 0.5 + 0.7 = 1.2 GB > 1 GB free.",
   "originalText": "Each request alone may fit in the 1 GB, but the pool is shared:\nC + A together ask 0.5 + 0.7 = 1.2 GB > 1 GB free.",
